guide polestar-completionist-alliance/class-rogue
title Rogue class quests (10-60) (Completionist)
faction Alliance
class Rogue
levels 10-60
category Class
zone Durotar
why Every Rogue class quest from level 10 on, in level order. The earlier ones are in the starting zone guides.
reward text What the Rogue quests give, quest by quest: abilities, forms, pets, totems or gear.
